    "text": "The value of $\\Delta H$ for cooling 2 mole of an ideal monoatomic gas from $225^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ to $125^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ at constant pressure will be [given $\\left.C_{p}=\\frac{5}{2} R\\right]$",
